description: Admin pages must use the product design system, not ad-hoc forms
alwaysApply: true
---

# Admin design system

- Use `src/components/ui/*` (`Field`, `Input`, `Select`, `Checkbox`, `OverlaySheet`) and `admin-form-grid` / `admin-card` / `ds-*`.
- Do not add raw inline-styled radios/inputs for new or rebuilt admin forms.
- Match patterns already used on `/admin/plans` and `/admin/data`.
- Calculator monetization UI lives at `/admin/analysis-settings` via `CalculatorAccessSettingsForm`.
